          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "छाँटना (chā̃ṭnā) is inherited from chaṇṭ, \"scatter\", a form CDIAL reconstructs from its descendants (CDIAL 4970). Hindi uses it for sifting and picking out."
